=== login
--- calls
exit: 0
--- stdout
--- stderr
curves: no-op. The portals are public; there is no session to mint.
To ask each portal for its cheapest answer, run `wealthdb-collect curves login --check`.
=== download
--- calls
python3
  <TMP>/w-curves/tree/collectors/curves/download.py
  --bronze-dir
  <TMP>/w-curves/xdgdata/wealthdb/curves
exit: 0
